#ASSERT `the minimum strokes of the cane` `splashing paint on a debtor's door` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the minimum strokes of the cane` `assault while collecting` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the minimum strokes of the cane` `paint and assault` EQUALS 6
