#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `threatening calls by a loan shark's runner` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `splashing paint on a debtor's door` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `assault while collecting` EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `paint and assault` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `repeat paint and assault` EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `repeat paint only` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the maximum strokes of the cane` `harassing calls by a licensed lender` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the means counts as damage to property` `paint`
